#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kmail.kcfg line 443
#: rc.cpp:311
msgid ""
"List of message part types to strip off mails that are being forwarded "
"inline."
msgstr ""
"List vun Narichtdeel-Typen, de Du vun Nettbreven bi't Wiederledden wegmaken "
"wullt"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kmail.kcfg line 447
#: rc.cpp:314
msgid "Show the text snippet management and insertion panel in the composer"
msgstr "De Textsnippel-Pleeg un dat Inföögpaneel binnen den Editor wiesen"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kmail.kcfg line 453
#: rc.cpp:317
msgid ""
"The maximum size in MB that email attachments are allowed to have (-1 for no "
"limit)."
msgstr ""
"De hööchste Grött in MB, de Nettpostbilagen hebben dörvt (-1 för \"keen Grenz"
"\")"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file kmail.kcfg line 514
#: rc.cpp:321
msgid ""
"Some emails, especially those generated automatically, do not specify the "
"character encoding which needs to be used to properly display them. In such "
"cases a fallback character encoding will be used, which you can configure "
"here. Set it to the character encoding most commonly used in your part of "
"the world. As a default the encoding configured for the whole system is used."
msgstr ""
"En poor Nettbreven, besünners automaatsch opstellte, gifft den Tekensett "
"nich an, de för en richtige Dorstellen bruukt warrt. Denn warrt dat Standard-"
"Tekensett bruukt, dat Du hier instellen kannst. Legg hier den Tekensett "
"fast, de in Dien Deel vun de Welt tomehrst bruukt warrt. As Vörinstellen "
"warrt de Koderen vun Dien Systeem bruukt."

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file kmail.kcfg line 520
#: rc.cpp:325
msgid ""
"Changing this from its default 'Auto' will force the use of the specified "
"encoding for all emails, regardless of what they specify themselves."
msgstr ""
"Wenn Du hier wat anners as \"Automaatsch\" instellst, warrt all Nettbreven "
"mit den niegen Tekensett wiest, de Angaven binnen de Narichten warrt "
"övergahn."

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file kmail.kcfg line 526
#: rc.cpp:331
msgid ""
"Enable this if you want smileys like :-) appearing in the message text to be "
"replaced by emoticons (small pictures)."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer dit, wenn Du ansteed vun Smileys binnen den Narichttext Snuten "
"(lütt Biller) hebben wullt."

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file kmail.kcfg line 531
#: rc.cpp:337
msgid ""
"Enable this option to show different levels of quoted text. Disable to hide "
"the levels of quoted text."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer dit, wenn Du verscheden Evenen binnen ziteert Text hebben wullt."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kmail.kcfg line 534
#: rc.cpp:340
msgid "Automatic collapse level:"
msgstr "Evene automaatsch infoolden:"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kmail.kcfg line 542
#: rc.cpp:343
msgid "Reduce font size for quoted text"
msgstr "Lüttere Schrift för ziteert Text bruken"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file kmail.kcfg line 543
#: rc.cpp:346
msgid "Enable this option to show quoted text with a smaller font."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer dit, wenn Du ziteert Text mit en lüttere Schrift dorstellen wullt"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kmail.kcfg line 554
#: rc.cpp:349
msgid "Show user agent in fancy headers"
msgstr "Nettpostprogramm binnen Smucke Köpp wiesen"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file kmail.kcfg line 555
#: rc.cpp:352
msgid ""
"Enable this option to get the User-Agent and X-Mailer header lines displayed "
"when using fancy headers."
msgstr ""
"Maak dit an, wenn Du binnen de Smucken Köpp de Regen \"Brukerprogramm\" un "
"\"X-Senner\" wiest hebben wullt."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kmail.kcfg line 560
#: rc.cpp:355
msgid "Allow to delete attachments of existing mails."
msgstr "Dat Wegdoon vun Bilagen vun vörhannen Nettbreven tolaten"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kmail.kcfg line 564
#: rc.cpp:358
msgid "Allow to edit attachments of existing mails."
msgstr "Dat Bewerken vun Bilagen vun vörhannen Nettbreven tolaten"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kmail.kcfg line 569
#: rc.cpp:361
msgid "Always decrypt messages when viewing or ask before decrypting"
msgstr "Narichten bi't Ankieken jümmers opslöteln, oder vördem fragen"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kmail.kcfg line 583
#: rc.cpp:365
msgid "Send Message Disposition Notifications with an empty sender."
msgstr "Narichttostand-Bescheden mit leddig Senner-Feld sennen"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file kmail.kcfg line 584
#: rc.cpp:368
