#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smimeconfiguration.ui line 16
#: rc.cpp:551
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, S/MIME certificates are validated using "
"Certificate Revocation Lists (CRLs)."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, warrt S/MIME-Zertifikaten över Zertifikaat-Torüchrooplisten "
"(ZTLen) pröövt."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smimeconfiguration.ui line 19
#: rc.cpp:554
msgid "Validate certificates using CRLs"
msgstr "Zertifikaat-Gellen mit ZTLen pröven"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smimeconfiguration.ui line 29
#: rc.cpp:557
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, S/MIME certificates are validated online using "
"the Online Certificates Status Protocol (OCSP). Fill in the URL of the OCSP "
"responder below."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, warrt S/MIME-Zertifikaten direktemang över dat Internet mit "
"dat Internet-Zertifikaattostand-Protokoll (\"Online Certificates Status "
"Protocol\", OCSP) pröövt. Giff bitte de URL vun den OCSP-Server nerrn in"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smimeconfiguration.ui line 32
#: rc.cpp:560
msgid "Validate certificates online (OCSP)"
msgstr "Zertifikaten över Internet pröven (OCSP)"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smimeconfiguration.ui line 39
#: rc.cpp:563
msgid "Online Certificate Validation"
msgstr "Internet-Zertifikaatprööv"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smimeconfiguration.ui line 49
#: rc.cpp:566
msgid "OCSP responder URL:"
msgstr "URL vun den OCSP-Server:"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smimeconfiguration.ui line 59
#: rc.cpp:569
msgid "OCSP responder signature:"
msgstr "Signatuur vun den OCSP-Server:"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smimeconfiguration.ui line 73
#: rc.cpp:572
msgid ""
"Enter here the address of the server for online validation of certificates "
"(OCSP responder). The URL is usually starting with http://."
msgstr ""
"Giff hier de Adress vun den Server för' Pröven vun Zertifikaattostänn över "
"Internet in (OCSP-Server). De URL fangt normalerwies mit http:// an."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smimeconfiguration.ui line 87
#: rc.cpp:575
msgid "Ignore service URL of certificates"
msgstr "Deenst-URL vun Zertifikaten övergahn"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smimeconfiguration.ui line 97
#: rc.cpp:578
msgid ""
"By default GnuPG uses the file ~/.gnupg/policies.txt to check if a "
"certificate policy is allowed. If this option is selected, policies are not "
"checked."
msgstr ""
"Standardwies kiekt GnuPG binnen de Datei \"~./gnupg/policies.txt\", wat en "
"Zertifikaatregel verlöövt is. Is dit aktiveert, warrt de Regeln nich pröövt."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smimeconfiguration.ui line 100
#: rc.cpp:581
msgid "Do not check certificate policies"
msgstr "Zertifikaatregeln nich pröven"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smimeconfiguration.ui line 107
#: rc.cpp:584
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, Certificate Revocation Lists are never used to "
"validate S/MIME certificates."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, warrt Zertifikaat-Torüchrooplisten nich för't Pröven vun S/"
"MIME-Zertifikaten bruukt."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smimeconfiguration.ui line 110
#: rc.cpp:587
msgid "Never consult a CRL"
msgstr "ZTLen nienich bruken"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smimeconfiguration.ui line 117
#: rc.cpp:590
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, missing issuer certificates are fetched when "
"necessary (this applies to both validation methods, CRLs and OCSP)"
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, warrt fehlen Rutgeverzertifikaten daallaadt, wenn nödig (gellt "
"för beed Pröövmetoden, ZTLen un OCSP)"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smimeconfiguration.ui line 120
#: rc.cpp:593
msgid "Fetch missing issuer certificates"
msgstr "Fehlen Rutgeverzertifikaten daalladen"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smimeconfiguration.ui line 131
#: rc.cpp:596
msgid "&HTTP Requests"
msgstr "&HTTP-Anfragen"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smimeconfiguration.ui line 137
#: rc.cpp:599
msgid "Entirely disables the use of HTTP for S/MIME."
msgstr "HTTP för S/MIME heel utmaken"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smimeconfiguration.ui line 140
#: rc.cpp:602
msgid "Do not perform any HTTP requests"
msgstr "Keen HTTP-Anfragen utföhren"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smimeconfiguration.ui line 147
#: rc.cpp:605
msgid ""
"When looking for the location of a CRL, the to-be-tested certificate usually "
"contains what are known as \"CRL Distribution Point\" (DP) entries, which "
"are URLs describing the way to access the URL. The first found DP entry is "
"used.  With this option all entries using the HTTP scheme are ignored when "
"looking for a suitable DP."
msgstr ""
"Vele Zertifikaten bargt Indrääg över ZTL-Verdeelsteden (\"CRL Distribution "
"Points\") - URLs, ünner de künnig maakt warrt, woneem sik de ZTL findt. De "
"eerste Verdeelsteed-Indrag warrt bruukt. Is disse Optschoon aktiveert, warrt "
"all Indrääg övergahn, de dat HTTP-Protokoll bruukt."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smimeconfiguration.ui line 150
#: rc.cpp:608
msgid "Ignore HTTP CRL distribution point of certificates"
msgstr "HTTP-ZTL-Verdeelsteden ut Zertifikaten övergahn"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smimeconfiguration.ui line 161
#: rc.cpp:611
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, the value of the HTTP proxy shown on the right "
"(which comes from the environment variable http_proxy) will be used for any "
"HTTP request."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, warrt de Weert för den HTTP-Proxy (wiest rechterhand, Weert "
"vun de Ümgeven-Variable \"http_proxy\") för all HTTP-Anfragen bruukt."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smimeconfiguration.ui line 164
#: rc.cpp:614
msgid "Use system HTTP proxy:"
msgstr "Systeem-Proxy för HTTP bruken: "

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smimeconfiguration.ui line 171
#: rc.cpp:617
msgid "Use this proxy for HTTP requests: "
msgstr "Dissen Proxy för HTTP-Anfragen bruken: "

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smimeconfiguration.ui line 192
#: rc.cpp:623
msgid ""
"Enter here the location of your HTTP Proxy, which will be used for all HTTP "
"requests relating to S/MIME. The syntax is host:port, for instance myproxy."
"nowhere.com:3128."
msgstr ""
"Giff hier de Adress vun Dien HTTP-Proxy in, de för all HTTP-Anfragen för S/"
"MIME bruukt warrt. De Schriefwies is \"Reekner:Port\", t.B. \"mienproxy."
"narms.nds:3128\"."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smimeconfiguration.ui line 217
#: rc.cpp:626
msgid "&LDAP Requests"
msgstr "&LDAP-Anfragen"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smimeconfiguration.ui line 225
#: rc.cpp:629
msgid "Entirely disables the use of LDAP for S/MIME."
msgstr "Maakt den Bruuk vun LDAP för S/MIME heel ut."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smimeconfiguration.ui line 228
#: rc.cpp:632
msgid "Do not perform any LDAP requests"
msgstr "Keen LDAP-Anfragen utföhren"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smimeconfiguration.ui line 235
#: rc.cpp:635
msgid ""
"When looking for the location of a CRL, the to-be-tested certificate usually "
"contains what are known as \"CRL Distribution Point\" (DP) entries, which "
"are URLs describing the way to access the URL. The first found DP entry is "
"used.  With this option all entries using the LDAP scheme are ignored when "
"looking for a suitable DP."
msgstr ""
"Vele Zertifikaten bargt Indrääg över ZTL-Verdeelsteden (\"CRL Distribution "
"Points\") - URLs, ünner de künnig maakt warrt, woneem sik de ZTL findt. De "
"eerste Verdeelsteed-Indrag warrt bruukt. Is disse Optschoon aktiveert, warrt "
"all Indrääg övergahn, de dat LDAP-Protokoll bruukt."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smimeconfiguration.ui line 238
#: rc.cpp:638
msgid "Ignore LDAP CRL distribution point of certificates"
msgstr "LDAP-ZTL-Verdeelsteden ut Zertifikaten övergahn"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smimeconfiguration.ui line 247
#: rc.cpp:641
msgid "Primary host for LDAP requests:"
msgstr "Hööftreekner för LDAP-Anfragen:"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smimeconfiguration.ui line 258
#: rc.cpp:644
msgid ""
"Entering a LDAP server here will make all LDAP requests go to that server "
"first. More precisely, this setting overrides any specified host and port "
"part in a LDAP URL and will also be used if host and port have been omitted "
"from the URL. Other LDAP servers will be used only if the connection to the "
"\"proxy\" failed.\n"
"The syntax is \"HOST\" or \"HOST:PORT\". If PORT is omitted, port 389 "
"(standard LDAP port) is used."
msgstr ""
"Wenn Du hier en LDAP-Server angiffst, gaht all LDAP-Anfragen toeerst na "
"dissen Server. Technisch warrt disse Reekner ansteed all angeven oder ok "
"nich angeven Reekner- un Portdelen vun en LDAP-URL bruukt. Anner LDAP-"
"Servers warrt bloots bruukt, wenn dat Tokoppeln na den \"Proxy\" fehlsleit.\n"
"De Schriefwies is \"Reekner\" oder \"Reekner:Port\". Is keen Port angeven, "
"warrt Port 389 (Standardport för LDAP) bruukt."

